[en.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY]
Take back the Tree of Harmony

[en.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY_desc]
My sister Pinkie Pie and Applejack of the Apple family were both bearers of the Elements of Harmony. That was one reason Cozy Glow arrested them and made them disappear after “Jahr Null”. The Tree of Harmony carries the harmony they left behind, and I cannot stand by while others control it. If I desire it, I shall obtain it.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY]
夺回谐律树

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TAKE_BACK_TREE_OF_HARMONY_desc]
我的妹妹萍琪派，以及苹果家族的苹果嘉儿都是和谐之元的组成部分，这也正是她们被可西光辉逮捕、并在“新元年”后下落不明的重要原因之一。谐律树承载着她们留下的谐律，我不该坐视它被把控在其他小马蹄中。只要我想，我就要得到。

